From 263751eb24b98d529e7a5c18a4b2ea8e0e1ff98b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yooztech <service@yooztech.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 15:52:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 20/22] Add macOS Codex quota monitoring

- Include complete native Codex account cards, structured persistence, startup/backoff, reset cards and source/refresh/expansion controls.
- Keep source-neutral quota periods, registry contract, controller and native renderer geometry in the base; register only Codex until the Go integration.
